{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1473358-how-to-make-yuki-onna-follower","id":1473358,"title":"How to make Yuki-Onna follower.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-01-26T14:55:46-08:00","id":1473358,"title":"How to make Yuki-Onna follower.","content":"So a friend of mine is starting a historical game taking place in japan, and I had the idea of playing a sort of brawler mountain hermit sort of character. I was thinking once the characters reach Hero level, he gains among other things, the Beast (Monkeys) purview (Since at least according to Nioh 2 monkeys are believed to be messengers of mountain gods), the Cold purview, and Epic Strength and/or Stamina, but in terms of birthrights one that immediately comes to mind that I wanted to try was a Yuki Onna as either a guide or a powerful follower. How exactly would I stat one in Scion 2e?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12517-storyteller323","name":"Storyteller323","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-01-26T17:53:52-08:00","id":1473367,"title":"","content":"I really would like some examples for Creatures. If what is following you is just &quot;one person/animal/thing&quot;, this is a Creature. Follower refers to a group of... things/people (if I got it right).<br /> <br /> So, imho, a Yuki-Onna would be a Creature, with the Extra Sorcery (Purview: Ice).... and what else would fit her personally. Maybe Sky...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"u